npm run dev# Children's Museum of Atlanta — Homepage v2

## Cline Rules (keep in sync with CLAUDE.md)

---

## Stack

- React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 6
- Tailwind CSS v4 with CSS custom properties (`--cma-*` tokens)
- `motion/react` for animations
- `react-router-dom` with **HashRouter** — all internal `<a>` hrefs must use `#/` prefix
- Font Awesome free tier (`@fortawesome/react-fontawesome`)
- Deploy: GitHub Pages at `https://mattybotstew.github.io/Homepagev2/`

---

