## File Structure

```
src/
├── main.tsx                  # Entry: router, lazy page imports, ErrorBoundary
├── app/
│   ├── App.tsx               # Homepage (route "/")
│   ├── pages/                # One file per route (all lazy-loaded)
│   ├── components/           # Section/feature components
│   └── data/                 # All static content as typed TS arrays
├── assets/                   # Images and SVGs
└── styles/
    ├── theme.css             # Design tokens + base element styles (h1–p, button)
    └── index.css             # Utility classes (.cma-*), @keyframes
```

`src/imports/` is dead code from Figma exports — never reference it.

