## Design Tokens

All colors are CSS custom properties exposed as Tailwind via `--color-cma-*`. Never hardcode hex values that match a token.

| Token             | Hex       |
| ----------------- | --------- |
| `cma-navy`        | `#1d3e6b` |
| `cma-orange`      | `#f7941e` |
| `cma-orange-dark` | `#b8620a` |
| `cma-teal`        | `#00ADBB` |
| `cma-teal-dark`   | `#007c87` |
| `cma-teal-light`  | `#4AD1DC` |
| `cma-teal-pale`   | `#cceff1` |
| `cma-blue-mid`    | `#346094` |
| `cma-blue-light`  | `#d4e3f3` |
| `cma-cream`       | `#fdf6ee` |
| `cma-slate`       | `#2c3a52` |

