## CSS Architecture

**Two files only — strict separation:**

- `theme.css` — tokens + global element styles (`h1`–`h4`, `p`, `button`, `input`, `label`). Nothing component-specific.
- `index.css` — `.cma-*` utility classes, `@keyframes`, component helpers.

**Rule:** Extract repeating styles to these files. Never duplicate Tailwind inline classes across components when a shared utility exists.

Global element styles are inherited — do not re-declare `font-family`, `font-size`, or `font-weight` on `h1`–`p` elements inline.

---

## Type Scale

| Element        | Size                        | Weight | Line-height                     |
| -------------- | --------------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------- |
| `h1`           | `clamp(34px, 5.9vw, 75px)`  | 900    | 0.95                            |
| `h2`           | `clamp(28px, 3.75vw, 48px)` | 800    | 1.1                             |
| `h3`           | `20px`                      | 900    | 1.1                             |
| `p`            | `15px`                      | 500    | 1.65                            |
| `.cma-eyebrow` | `15px`                      | 700    | uppercase, 3.9px letter-spacing |

