## Page Templates

1. **Hero + stacked sections** — `ContactPage`, `DonatePage`
2. **Sidebar + article card** — `FieldTripsProgramContent`, `MuseumOnTheGoProgramContent`, `ScoutsProgramContent`, `EducatorPDProgramContent`
3. **ArticleContentWithSidebar** — `GivingCirclePage` (non-event), `ExhibitPage`
4. **FundraisingEventContent** — `imagination-ball`, `tournament-for-play`, `fun-on-tap`. Driven by `fundraisingEvent` field on `givingCircles.ts` entry. `photosAfterSponsors: true` swaps photo/sponsor section order.
5. **GivingHero + sections** — `SupportPage`, `CorporatePartnerPage`

---

## Data Layer

All content is in `src/app/data/`. No runtime API calls (WordPress integration in progress but not yet used).

| File          | Type        | Used by                   |
| ------------- | ----------- | ------------------------- |
| `exhibits.ts` | `Exhibit[]` | ExhibitsPage, ExhibitPage |

**Exhibit body rich text:** Prefer optional `content?: string` (HTML) rendered with `.cma-prose` in `ArticleContent` — same contract as News `ArticleItem.content`. Zone rows use WordPress Media & Text markup (`.wp-block-media-text.has-media-on-the-right`). Sponsors use a `.is-sponsor-panel` cream tile grid — centered `h2`, optional `.is-sponsor-intro`, then `.is-sponsor-item` tiles each with an optional `.is-sponsor-role` eyebrow (render it either before the figure as an eyebrow or after as a navy label), a white `figure.is-sponsor-logo` tile, and an optional `.is-sponsor-note` below the figure. `figure.is-sponsor-logo` supports `--wide` (short full-width logo) and `--banner` (full-width responsive banner) modifier classes; stacked panels separate via `.is-sponsor-panel + .is-sponsor-panel`. Keep `paragraphs` / `sections` as fallback for exhibits not yet migrated.

| `events.ts` | event objects | CalendarPage, EventPage |
| `programs.ts` | `Program[]` | ProgramPage, EducatorsPage |
| `givingCircles.ts` | `GivingCircle[]` | GivingCirclePage |
| `articles.ts` | `ArticleItem[]` | NewsPage, ArticlePage |
| `resources.ts` | `ResourceItem[]` | PlayfulLearningPage, ResourcePage |
| `navLinks.ts` | `NavLink[]` | Header, MobileHeader, Footer |

**EventItem fields of note:**

- `separateTicket?: boolean` — set `true` on after-hours ticketed events (Trick-or-Treat, Bubble Bash, etc.). CalendarPage card + EventPage detail should render a "Separate Ticket Required" pill when true; nothing extra when false/absent.

**Giving Circles draft system:** Entries with `draft: true` in `givingCircles.ts` are excluded from the "Other Ways to Give" related section and redirect to `/support`. No circles are currently draft.

