## Button & Link Conventions

```tsx
// Primary CTA (pill button)
<a href="#/..." className="cma-btn bg-cma-orange text-cma-navy hover:bg-cma-orange-dark font-black">
// <a> tags need font-black explicitly — global button style only applies to <button>

// Outline variant
<a href="#/..." className="cma-btn cma-btn-outline-teal font-black">

// Text link (standalone, outside paragraph copy)
<a href="#/..." className="cma-text-link">Learn More</a>
```

Standard CTA padding: `px-[24px] py-[13px]`, `rounded-[1000px]`.

