## Shadows

| Class              | Use                      |
| ------------------ | ------------------------ |
| `shadow-cma-warm`  | Cards with orange accent |
| `shadow-cma-panel` | Expanded overlay panels  |
| `shadow-cma-btn`   | Buttons                  |
| `shadow-cma-card`  | General content cards    |

---

## Images

- Import as ES modules: `import img from '../../assets/file.webp'`
- Prefer `.webp`; `.png` is acceptable for assets that haven't been converted
- Many assets use Figma-exported hash names (e.g. `1bfa9acf….webp`) — use as-is
- Never use string paths for images

---

## Eyebrow Sections

Always wrap sections containing `.cma-eyebrow` in `overflow-hidden` — 3.9px letter-spacing overflows at narrow viewports.

---

## Section Container

```tsx
<div className="cma-section-container"> {/* max-w-[1280px], auto margins, px 20→40→80px */}
```

---

## Sponsor Tier Display (FundraisingEventContent)

- Featured/Presenting tier: `w-[360px] h-[220px]` logo placeholder
- Standard tiers: `w-[120px] h-[64px]` logo placeholder
- Featured tier spans `md:col-span-2`

