---

## FAQ Patterns

**Standalone FAQ** (PlanYourVisitFAQs, ContactPage):

- Each item: own `rounded-[24px]` card, `border-2 border-black/5`
- Open: `bg-cma-teal-pale`, `font-black` label
- Closed: `bg-white`, `font-semibold` label
- Icon: `faPlus`/`faMinus`, `text-cma-orange text-[12px]`, right-aligned

**Embedded FAQ** (inside program sidebar+article pages):

- Flat `border-b border-black/10` list — do not change to card style

---

## What NOT To Do

- Never use `<a href="/path">` for internal links — use `#/path` or `<Link to="/path">`
- Never hardcode brand hex values — use `cma-*` tokens
- Never use `BrowserRouter` — app uses `HashRouter`
- Never reference `src/imports/` — dead code
- Never add comments explaining what code does — only for non-obvious constraints
- Never add error handling for scenarios that can't happen in a static SPA
- Never create a 6th page template — match one of the five above
- Never add features beyond what the task requires

